  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Progress Bar",
    "Description",
    "Linear progress indicator for long-running tasks. Use for file uploads, batch operations, multi-step workflows, and completion meters.",
    "Types (planned)",
    "determinate     Known progress (0–100%). Shows exact fraction complete.\nindeterminate   Unknown duration. Animated bar — do not show percent.\n\nVariant axes currently placeholder (Variant2–Variant5). Rename before publishing.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Always pair with a descriptive label above the bar ('Uploading presentation.pdf').\nShow percentage only for determinate bars.\nAnnounce start and completion with aria-live=polite.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Pair with a descriptive label\nDO   Use indeterminate when total duration is unknown\nDO   Announce completion via aria-live=polite\nDO   Show percentage for determinate bars",
    "DON'T   Use for operations under 1 second (use Spinner)\nDON'T   Show percent on indeterminate bars\nDON'T   Stack multiple bars without clear labels\nDON'T   Publish before variant axes are named"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
